3. Records: Contractor shall assist in creating complete and detailed records and other books and records regarding Services as may be required and in accordance with applicable requirements. All records created as part of this Agreement shall be the property of The Linguals.

4. General Contractor Status: Contractor is an independent contractor with respect to The Linguals, and nothing in this Agreement is intended, nor shall be construed, to create between the Parties an employer/employee or joint venture relationship. Accordingly, the Parties agree as follows:

