5. Fees: The Linguals agrees to pay Contractor a fee for its Services rendered hereunder in the amount stated in the Assignment. The Linguals shall pay the fee to Contractor within 45-60 days after The Linguals’s receipt of Contractor’s invoice for an Assignment that has been completed to the satisfaction of The Linguals. Contractor shall be solely responsible for any fees associated with payment of the Assignment, including domestic and international wire transfer fees and PayPal fee or any other transaction fee, where applicable.

